### Task Manager API example requests — documentation only
### To use in a REST client, set baseUrl, csrfToken, and UUID variables.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@wid = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@pid = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@iid = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@statusId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
@csrfToken = REPLACE_ME

### Current account. Browser session cookie must be supplied by the REST client.
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json

### List workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
Accept: application/json

### Create project
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{wid}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: a1bb2405-ef1b-41cc-94fb-fe8a4bd2d1e3

{
  "name": "Website",
  "key": "WEB",
  "visibility": "private",
  "template": "kanban"
}

### View project statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{pid}}/statuses
Accept: application/json

### Create item
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{pid}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 30dbb67d-38b6-410b-b8a5-63a0b33105f1

{
  "typeKey": "task",
  "title": "Implement workspace switcher",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-02"
}

### Read canonical item and copy ETag response header for writes
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/{{iid}}
Accept: application/json

### Update item; use actual ETag from prior GET
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/items/{{iid}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
If-Match: "1"

{
  "title": "Implement workspace switcher + permissions"
}

### Transition item; use fresh ETag from most recent GET/PATCH
POST {{baseUrl}}/items/{{iid}}/transitions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 9e8dbabe-e484-45d6-b1a5-3c4ca3130ee6
If-Match: "2"

{
  "toStatusId": "{{statusId}}"
}

### List items with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{pid}}/items?limit=50&sort=rank
Accept: application/json

### Add comment. Actual rich text editor JSON schema to be finalized before implementation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/items/{{iid}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 9a6408ee-bbee-4a2b-89cc-b6114de65f02

{
  "body": { "type": "doc", "content": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Please review this change." }] }
  ] },
  "mentionedUserIds": []
}

### Get effective project permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{pid}}/capabilities
Accept: application/json

### Mark notifications read (workspace scope)
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/read-all
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 7a51bfc5-7953-4d2a-8252-0f5411c44bdd

{ "workspaceId": "{{wid}}" }
